<title>TAIWAN: Earthquake rocks Taiwan.</title>
<headline>Earthquake rocks Taiwan.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake struck Taiwan on Sunday, shaking office buildings, but there were no immediate reports of injuries or damage.</p>
<p>Officials from the Central Weather Bureau were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Earthquakes are relatively common on the island but rarely cause major damage.</p>
</text>
